# Subsidiarity

*Subsidiarities, principle of subsidiarity, subsidiarity principle, principle of subsidiarities, subsidiarity principles, Subsidiarities, principle of subsidiarities, subsidiarity principles, Subsidiarities, principle of subsidiarities, subsidiarity principles*

The idea that social and political issues should be dealt with at the most immediate/local level that is consistent with the resolution.

