# Instrumental Meritocracy

*Instrumental Meritocracies, consequentialist meritocracy, consequentialist meritocracies, instrumental merit, instrumental merits, Instrumental Meritocracies, consequentialist meritocracies, instrumental merits, Instrumental Meritocracies, consequentialist meritocracies, instrumental merits*

Allocation of social goods by merit is only justifiable because it tends to produce the most optimal outcome.

