# Pareto Efficiency

*Pareto Efficiencies, principle of efficiency, principle of efficiencies, Pareto Efficiencies, principle of efficiencies, Pareto Efficiencies, principle of efficiencies*

A situation whereby no one can be made better off without making everyone else worse off.

